  "title": "Personalized Christian Woman Scripture Photo Throw Blanket - Vintage",
  "handle": "personalized-christian-woman-scripture-photo-throw-blanket-vintage",
  "body_html": "<p>At Jeminise, we offer this personalized Christian blanket, a perfect blend of faith, love, and comfort. Designed for Christian women, this blanket serves as an ideal keepsake, offering daily encouragement and spiritual inspiration.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> A perfect personalized gift that combines faith, love, and comfort, making it an ideal keepsake for Christian women.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Simply select your preferred design and add a custom name or text to create a one-of-a-kind, meaningful gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) for a perfect fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspirational Christian Design:</strong> Features faith-based messages and uplifting Christian themes for daily encouragement and spiritual inspiration.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> This personalized blanket is ideal for birthdays, Christmas, Valentine's Day, New Year, or special milestones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from durable and comfortable Polyester.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Hand Wash Only for lasting quality.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Chrsitian I Am Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small, Medium, Large, X-Large</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Hand Wash Only</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
